{"strongs": "H2000", "word": "הָמַם", "translit": "ha.mam", "root": "המם", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "make a noise, move noisily, confuse, discomfit", "definition": "הָמַם verb make a noise, move noisily, confuse, discomfit (compare [ הום ]) — Qal Perfect וְהָמַם consecutive Isa 28:28 suffix הֲמָמַ֫נִי Jer 51:34 Qr ( Kt הֲמָמָ֫נוּ ), הֲמָמָם 2Chr 15:6 1 singular וְהַמֹּתִ֫י Exod 23:27 Imperfect וַיָּ֫הָם Exod 14:24 ; Judg 4:15 suffix וַיְּהֻמֵּם Josh 10:10 ; 1Sam 7:10 ; Ps 18:15 + 2Sam 22:15 Kt (doubtless right; Qr וַיָּהֹ֑ם ); 2 masculine singular suffix וּתְהֻמֵּם Ps 144:6 Infinitive suffix לְהֻמָּם Deut 2:15 ; Esth 9:24 — 1. move noisily , transitive, drive a wagon in threshing גִּלְגַּל עֶגְּלָתוֺ וּפָרָשָׁיו ׳ ה Isa 28:28 (|| דושׁ ). 2. confuse, discomfit , with accusative Exod 14:24 ; Exod 23:27 ; Josh 10:10 ; Judg 4:15 ; 1Sam 7:10 ; Ps 18:15 = 2Sam 22:15 (|| הפיץ ), Ps 144:6 (|| id. ); discomfit, vex , 2Chr 15:6 with accusative & בְּכָלצָֿרָה of instrumental; with accusative also Deut 2:15 (followed by עַד תֻּמָּם ), Esth 9:24 (followed by לְאַבְּדָם ); probably also Jer 51:34 (|| אָכַל ), compare הוּם Deut 7:23 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2195')\">BDB2195</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2000')\">H2000</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2194')\">BDB2194</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2196')\">BDB2196</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>הָמַם</bdbheb> <b>verb</b> <highlightword>make a noise, move noisily, confuse, discomfit</highlightword> (compare [<bdbheb>הום</bdbheb>]) — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> <bdbheb>וְהָמַם</bdbheb> consecutive <ref ref=\"Isa 28:28\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(23,28,28)\">Isa 28:28</ref> suffix <bdbheb>הֲמָמַ֫נִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 51:34\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(24,51,34)\">Jer 51:34</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup> <bdbheb>הֲמָמָ֫נוּ</bdbheb>), <bdbheb>הֲמָמָם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 15:6\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(14,15,6)\">2Chr 15:6</ref> 1 singular <bdbheb>וְהַמֹּתִ֫י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 23:27\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(2,23,27)\">Exod 23:27</ref> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>וַיָּ֫הָם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 14:24\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(2,14,24)\">Exod 14:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 4:15\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(7,4,15)\">Judg 4:15</ref> suffix <bdbheb>וַיְּהֻמֵּם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 10:10\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(6,10,10)\">Josh 10:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 7:10\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(9,7,10)\">1Sam 7:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 18:15\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(19,18,15)\">Ps 18:15</ref> + <ref ref=\"2Sam 22:15\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(10,22,15)\">2Sam 22:15</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup> (doubtless right; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup> <bdbheb>וַיָּהֹ֑ם</bdbheb>); 2 masculine singular suffix <bdbheb>וּתְהֻמֵּם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 144:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"144\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"144\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,144,6)\">Ps 144:6</ref> <highlight>Infinitive suffix</highlight> <bdbheb>לְהֻמָּם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 2:15\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(5,2,15)\">Deut 2:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Esth 9:24\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(17,9,24)\">Esth 9:24</ref> — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>move noisily</highlight>, transitive, drive a wagon in threshing <bdbheb>גִּלְגַּל עֶגְּלָתוֺ וּפָרָשָׁיו</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 28:28\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(23,28,28)\">Isa 28:28</ref> (|| <bdbheb>דושׁ</bdbheb>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>confuse, discomfit</highlight>, with accusative <ref ref=\"Exod 14:24\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(2,14,24)\">Exod 14:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 23:27\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(2,23,27)\">Exod 23:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 10:10\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(6,10,10)\">Josh 10:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 4:15\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(7,4,15)\">Judg 4:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 7:10\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(9,7,10)\">1Sam 7:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 18:15\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(19,18,15)\">Ps 18:15</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Sam 22:15\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(10,22,15)\">2Sam 22:15</ref> (|| <bdbheb>הפיץ</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Ps 144:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"144\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"144\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,144,6)\">Ps 144:6</ref> (|| <highlight>id.</highlight>); <highlight>discomfit, vex</highlight>, <ref ref=\"2Chr 15:6\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(14,15,6)\">2Chr 15:6</ref> with accusative &amp; <bdbheb>בְּכָלצָֿרָה</bdbheb> of instrumental; with accusative also <ref ref=\"Deut 2:15\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(5,2,15)\">Deut 2:15</ref> (followed by <bdbheb>עַד תֻּמָּם</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Esth 9:24\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(17,9,24)\">Esth 9:24</ref> (followed by <bdbheb>לְאַבְּדָם</bdbheb>); probably also <ref ref=\"Jer 51:34\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(24,51,34)\">Jer 51:34</ref> (|| <bdbheb>אָכַל</bdbheb>), compare <bdbheb>הוּם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 7:23\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(5,7,23)\">Deut 7:23</ref>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Isa 28:28", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 28, "verse": 28}, {"raw": "Jer 51:34", "book": "JER", "chapter": 51, "verse": 34}, {"raw": "2Chr 15:6", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 15, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Exod 23:27", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 23, "verse": 27}, {"raw": "Exod 14:24", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 14, "verse": 24}, {"raw": "Judg 4:15", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 4, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Josh 10:10", "book": "JOS", "chapter": 10, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "1Sam 7:10", "book": "1SA", "chapter": 7, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Ps 18:15", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 18, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "2Sam 22:15", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 22, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Ps 144:6", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 144, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Deut 2:15", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 2, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Esth 9:24", "book": "EST", "chapter": 9, "verse": 24}, {"raw": "Deut 7:23", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 7, "verse": 23}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["הָמַם", "הום", "וְהָמַם", "הֲמָמַ֫נִי", "הֲמָמָ֫נוּ", "הֲמָמָם", "וְהַמֹּתִ֫י", "וַיָּ֫הָם", "וַיְּהֻמֵּם", "וַיָּהֹ֑ם", "וּתְהֻמֵּם", "לְהֻמָּם", "גִּלְגַּל עֶגְּלָתוֺ וּפָרָשָׁיו", "׳", "ה", "דושׁ", "הפיץ", "בְּכָלצָֿרָה", "עַד תֻּמָּם", "לְאַבְּדָם", "אָכַל", "הוּם"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": ["Kt", "Qr"]}, "covers": [], "bdbid": "BDB2195", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}